WEBVTT

NOTE storyboard documented-vs-observed: 5 steps and 2 cards

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.548
Seen on the wire, missing from the record

2
00:00:02.548 --> 00:00:09.748
Demo HQ's map: one line per cable, and each line says how old it is.

3
00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:16.793
Review lists the links seen on the wire that the record lacks.

4
00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:25.047
On the map it is a ghost link: seen on the wire, and not documented.

5
00:00:25.047 --> 00:00:32.070
The Changes lens: what changed on the map in the last 7 days.

6
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:40.106
Ask the map: press Q, ask where something is, and the map answers.

7
00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.673
What the wire shows and what the record says, on one map.
